<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - China Act - 140,000 tonnes Richards Bay/Rotterdam 15-25/2 $7.75 fio scale load/40,000 shinc Norfolk (amended).</p>
<p>Konpolis - 75,000 tonnes Davant/tarragona 1-15/2 $9.25 fio 30,000 shinc/24,000 shex Enemm.</p>
<p>Amadeus - 60,000 tonnes Hampton Roads/Ijmiuden 25-31/1 $8.50 fio five days shinc Hoogovens.</p>
<p>ORE - Pytchley - 120,000 tonnes Tuburao/Ponta da Madeira/Kaohsiung 5-15/2 $10.60 option Sepetiba Bay $10.85 fio 40,000 shinc/38,000s shinc China Steel.</p>
</text>
